                        "name":  "places/ChIJTxvEpoyrQjQRUM9XOOLWjv4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOS1YxbERXbUpIVVZoelgwSXRlVlJtVTNGd1ZsRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "7 個月前",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "老闆人很nice～餐前酒很好喝😍\n有兩種基酒，我選老闆推薦的金巴利香甜酒(campari)，特色是比另一款苦一點點～\n很喜歡生火腿+芝麻葉的組合，非常經典！\n（看到評論說生火腿太鹹，但生火腿本來就是比較鹹XDD）\nCannoli也很好吃，完全是記憶中的味道🤤\n因為剛好會說英文，所以聊的很愉快！\n推薦給喜歡異國料理的人～\nA perfect place to enjoy authentic Italian cuisine. Everything’s delicious, and the owner is super friendly! Don’t miss the aperitivo!!!",
                                     "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
